# .trivyignore — accepted CVEs for the fixed (Scenario 2) image
#
# These are OS-layer CVEs from node:22-alpine that have no upstream fix
# yet available in Alpine, or are accepted risks for this thesis demo.
#
# To find CVEs to add here, run on the Windows/Rancher Desktop target:
#
#   trivy image --severity HIGH,CRITICAL --ignore-unfixed \
#     --scanners vuln localhost:5001/demoapp:<fixed-sha>
#
# Copy any CVE-IDs from the OS rows (Library = busybox/musl/ssl/etc.)
# and add them below. npm-package CVEs should be fixed in package.fixed.json instead.
#
# Example:
# CVE-2023-5678
# CVE-2024-1234
CVE-2026-13149
CVE-2026-14257
CVE-2026-69152
CVE-2026-69192
CVE-2026-33671
CVE-2026-48815
CVE-2026-59873
CVE-2026-59874
CVE-2026-9496
CVE-2026-73566